1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,300
Day 1 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,400
Yesterday, Leo was
all alone…

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,400
…and then you
showed up!

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,500
Yesterday: 1 resident.

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,500
