€120,000.

17
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,900
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

18
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,400
Who wants to be
the first principal?

19
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,800
Tell me in the
comments!
